Closed forms for the maximum number of zero-sum guard-charge groups in F3 and F5
Prepared in SHIN09-git's research project with substantial OpenAI Codex assistance.
Apache-2.0.

Inverse-pair cancellation and both small-scalar-field formulas are from
research/monomial-guard-settlement/ALGORITHM.md at
03caa7f6cb5bd21c834024e9d81f6b43eb325b91 (CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds PR 6712).
The labeled optimum and histogram used here come from the adjacent labeled
and charge-count DP packages pinned in verification/RESULT.json. Earlier
contributors and debt-partition literature are credited in
../monomial-guard-dp-lean/reference/ORIGINAL-NOTICE.

This package formalizes the pair-exchange argument, proves that all multiplicity
witnesses lift to labeled partitions, verifies both modular weight bounds and
attaining decompositions, and identifies two executable count-based formulas
with the existing HZ.blockCount. The general DP is used to cross-check examples.
